{
  "name": "Quiz Auto Grader",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Cargar clave de respuestas\nPOST /quiz-reference\n```json\n{\n  \"quiz_id\": \"quiz-01\",\n  \"content\": \"q1: La capital de Francia es París (1 pt)...\"\n}\n```\nSe guarda en Pinecone usando quiz_id como namespace.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Nota Carga",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-520, -560]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Calificar cuestionario\nPOST /quiz-auto-grader\n```json\n{\n  \"quiz_id\": \"quiz-01\",\n  \"student_id\": \"A123\",\n  \"student_name\": \"Ana López\",\n  \"answers\": [\n    { \"question_id\": \"q1\", \"question\": \"¿Capital de Francia?\", \"answer\": \"París\" }\n  ]\n}\n```\nResponde con la calificación en JSON y la registra en Google Sheets.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 1700,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Nota Calificación",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-520, -80]
    },

    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "quiz-reference",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Webhook Clave",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-300, -360],
      "webhookId": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000aa"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "insert",
        "pineconeIndex": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "quiz-auto-grader",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "quiz-auto-grader"
        },
        "options": {
          "pineconeNamespace": "={{ $json.body.quiz_id }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Pinecone Insertar",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.vectorStorePinecone",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [-60, -360],
      "credentials": {
        "pineconeApi": { "id": "PINECONE_API", "name": "Pinecone account" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "embed-multilingual-v3.0"
      },
      "id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Embeddings Carga",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.embeddingsCohere",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-120, -180],
      "credentials": {
        "cohereApi": { "id": "COHERE_API", "name": "Cohere" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonMode": "expressionData",
